<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Mining makes call on stock rights.</title>
<headline>Manila Mining makes call on stock rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Mining Corp said on Tuesday its board had made a call for the payment of the 50 percent balance for its one-for-one stock rights offer which was made in 1990.</p>
<p>The shares were offered at one centavo each.</p>
<p>The deadline for the payment of the said balance is March 28, assistant corporate secretary Odette Atienza told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
